# E §3.1 step 1 (a joint model's use lines pin its members, LOAD-PIN), INTERFACE §1 (reprint reads its files as
# run does; tally 2.1.6, issue #74): reprint of a joint model whose member a/a.tally isn't given refuses, as run
# does, before it prints anything. tally 2.1.5's refcore printed the joint file and its hash, exit 0.
=== options reprint
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "a/a.tally" sha256 "244e202f2765069c3eeedc89b40d367e39ee638acaea58bad6d4a488b90a6072"

ask x: a.twice
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PIN a/a.tally doesn't match its sha256 in use a (no such file)
